          "open_space_designation": "Other",
          "description": "The application seeks permission to remodel the existing rear courtyard of the current Public House (to E(b) use class and Sui Generis) by developing seven temporary timber structure kiosks to improve the use of the popular outdoor space.  Additionally, the proposal aims to create a roof terrace on the top of the Public House's vacant flat roof by adjusting the current space and adding a perimetral slender metal railing to protect future users. The roof terrace will have independent access directly from the Salvador passageway and is intended to be used as an informal terrace primarily during the warm summer months.",
